1
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:33,578
=Against The Current=

2
00:01:33,579 --> 00:01:35,000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

3
00:01:35,180 --> 00:01:36,920
=Episode 7=
(This drama does not correspond)

4
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:38,200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

5
00:01:38,210 --> 00:01:41,110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

6
00:01:45,879 --> 00:01:47,599
Madam Feng, Lanxiang.

7
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:49,439
Wait downstairs.

8
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:50,840
- Yes.
- Yes.

9
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:52,439
Shopkeeper Liu.

10
00:01:52,936 --> 00:01:53,950
Go tell Young Lady Qian

11
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:55,480
to bring all the account books.

12
00:01:56,568 --> 00:01:58,640
I'll question her
after I've gone through them.

13
00:01:59,040 --> 00:01:59,480
Yes.

14
00:02:37,060 --> 00:02:40,300
(Su Plum Blossom Pastries)

15
00:03:11,960 --> 00:03:12,719
Young Lady Qian.

16
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:14,560
Young Madam is already inside.

17
00:03:30,479 --> 00:03:32,759
(How could a woman
have such large feet?)

18
00:03:34,712 --> 00:03:35,928
(Something's not right.)

19
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:36,680
(That's a man.)

20
00:03:48,600 --> 00:03:50,860
Young Madam is going through
the accounts very carefully.

21
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:52,240
She won't be down anytime soon.

22
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:54,240
Come sit with me.

23
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,159
What's wrong?

24
00:04:17,940 --> 00:04:19,959
(Jinxiu House)

25
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:21,300
- Young Master.
- Young Master.

26
00:04:25,192 --> 00:04:26,750
We've been taking turns
keeping watch for several days.

27
00:04:26,800 --> 00:04:28,879
This morning, we waited for
Young Madam to leave the residence

28
00:04:28,920 --> 00:04:30,690
and followed her
all the way to Jinxiu House.

29
00:04:30,824 --> 00:04:32,070
We've checked out Jinxiu House.

30
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,230
Aside from the shop employees,

31
00:04:33,240 --> 00:04:35,080
everyone coming and going
has been a woman.

32
00:04:35,144 --> 00:04:36,280
Nothing seems unusual.

33
00:04:42,776 --> 00:04:44,240
We've been staking it out for days.

34
00:04:44,328 --> 00:04:45,656
Let's go have a look around.

35
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:50,800
Let's go.

36
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:59,460
(Jinxiu House)

37
00:05:01,439 --> 00:05:03,040
My period started.

38
00:05:03,199 --> 00:05:04,360
I caught a bit of a chill,

39
00:05:04,360 --> 00:05:05,639
and I'm not feeling well.

40
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:08,000
I'd like some brown sugar water.

41
00:05:11,240 --> 00:05:12,680
Being a woman can be such a nuisance.

42
00:05:15,240 --> 00:05:16,160
Go out

43
00:05:16,170 --> 00:05:18,520
and have a bowl of fermented rice
with brown sugar and egg.

44
00:05:18,920 --> 00:05:20,439
Bring me a bowl too while you're at it.

45
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,560
Thank you, Madam Feng.

46
00:05:30,079 --> 00:05:31,639
She really is young.

47
00:05:36,488 --> 00:05:37,560
Pick whichever you like.

48
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:39,680
Do you know what this is?

49
00:05:44,072 --> 00:05:45,080
The Four Don'ts Dolls.

50
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:49,639
And this one?

51
00:05:49,864 --> 00:05:51,368
This one's called Don't Look.

52
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:54,720
This one

53
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:56,390
is called Don't Listen.

54
00:05:58,160 --> 00:06:00,160
If you see something you shouldn't

55
00:06:00,648 --> 00:06:02,190
or hear something you shouldn't...

56
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:31,496
You know what that means, don't you?

57
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:49,519
(Lin Jinqi is here, too.)

58
00:06:52,079 --> 00:06:54,040
(If Lin Jinqi realizes I know,)

59
00:06:54,439 --> 00:06:55,560
(I'll surely die.)

60
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,879
(If Zhao Xingtang realizes I know,)

61
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,920
(I'll surely die, too.)

62
00:07:04,500 --> 00:07:08,700
(Jinxiu House)

63
00:07:08,700 --> 00:07:09,544
This is the place.

64
00:07:26,199 --> 00:07:27,600
You blind fool!

65
00:07:27,639 --> 00:07:28,879
Watch where you're going!

66
00:07:29,160 --> 00:07:31,120
My clothes!

67
00:07:31,240 --> 00:07:31,879
I'm sorry.

68
00:07:31,920 --> 00:07:33,160
And my fabric!

69
00:07:33,160 --> 00:07:33,879
I'll pay for it.

70
00:07:33,959 --> 00:07:34,800
I promise I'll pay.

71
00:07:34,879 --> 00:07:36,079
Can you even afford it?

72
00:07:36,080 --> 00:07:36,808
What's going on?

73
00:07:38,776 --> 00:07:39,870
What are you doing here?

74
00:07:41,079 --> 00:07:41,600
I...

75
00:07:46,319 --> 00:07:48,040
Someone, come quickly!

76
00:07:48,319 --> 00:07:50,920
This shop is mistreating me!

77
00:07:51,079 --> 00:07:54,879
They're bullying
a helpless widow like me!

78
00:07:56,199 --> 00:07:59,639
They knocked me down,
and no one's doing anything about it!

79
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,759
Look what they've done to me!

80
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:04,000
This is outrageous!

81
00:08:04,800 --> 00:08:06,759
Just look what they've done to me!

82
00:08:07,160 --> 00:08:08,480
If you don't settle this today,

83
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:11,360
I'm not getting up!

84
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:14,519
Everyone, come judge for yourselves!

85
00:08:14,712 --> 00:08:15,600
This is outrageous!

86
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,800
(Now I can prove I wasn't there)

87
00:08:18,136 --> 00:08:19,928
(and knew nothing about it, right?)

88
00:08:20,920 --> 00:08:21,879
Don't touch my fabric!

89
00:08:21,879 --> 00:08:22,759
Deal with this!

90
00:08:24,920 --> 00:08:26,759
They're bullying me!

91
00:08:26,759 --> 00:08:29,000
This shop is mistreating me!

92
00:08:33,559 --> 00:08:34,320
Zijin.

93
00:08:35,120 --> 00:08:36,039
What's going on?

94
00:08:37,144 --> 00:08:39,240
It seems a customer
is causing trouble in the shop.

95
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:41,120
A large crowd has gathered to watch.

96
00:08:41,416 --> 00:08:43,240
Shopkeeper Liu
has already gone to handle it.

97
00:08:50,679 --> 00:08:52,600
Why don't you head back for today?

98
00:08:54,240 --> 00:08:56,559
We can settle the accounts another day.

99
00:08:57,879 --> 00:08:58,759
What a disappointment.

100
00:08:59,919 --> 00:09:01,080
If you're this timid

101
00:09:01,352 --> 00:09:03,480
and want to run
at the slightest disturbance,

102
00:09:03,880 --> 00:09:05,432
why did you come to see me at all?

103
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,480
Everything I've done

104
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,000
has been for you.

105
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,039
I'm a man. I don't fear
what people might say.

106
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:29,639
But this world
is especially harsh on women.

107
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:33,120
Even gossip can ruin a woman.

108
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:02,519
Wait until I've left,

109
00:10:02,552 --> 00:10:04,072
then put on a show with Shopkeeper Liu

110
00:10:04,104 --> 00:10:04,760
before you leave.

111
00:10:05,240 --> 00:10:05,960
I know.

112
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,639
You're already dressed like this.

113
00:10:08,039 --> 00:10:09,879
Even Shopkeeper Liu
thinks you're a woman.

114
00:10:10,799 --> 00:10:12,279
Who would suspect anything?

115
00:10:13,639 --> 00:10:14,399
I'm leaving, then.

116
00:10:33,279 --> 00:10:34,519
Go get your young lady ready.

117
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,399
Remember to clean up the bed

118
00:10:36,919 --> 00:10:38,279
and leave no trace behind.

119
00:12:37,820 --> 00:12:41,420
(Zhao Xingtang, Young)

120
00:12:42,399 --> 00:12:43,879
My period started.

121
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:45,720
I'm unclean right now,

122
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:48,559
so we can't share a bed tonight.

123
00:13:01,192 --> 00:13:02,856
Then I'll sleep in the side chamber.

124
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:11,240
With my condition,

125
00:13:11,440 --> 00:13:13,279
sometimes I go months without a period,

126
00:13:13,799 --> 00:13:15,480
and other times the bleeding drags on

127
00:13:15,480 --> 00:13:17,272
for two or three months
without stopping.

128
00:13:17,679 --> 00:13:20,759
I'm afraid tomorrow, the day after,

129
00:13:20,919 --> 00:13:23,360
the day after that,
and even the next day,

130
00:13:24,088 --> 00:13:25,840
we still won't be able to share a bed.

131
00:13:29,120 --> 00:13:29,879
I understand.

132
00:13:35,860 --> 00:13:38,100
♪My thoughts are like a red umbrella♪

133
00:13:38,460 --> 00:13:40,820
♪Drifting through the rain♪

134
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:46,140
♪Held tightly in my hand,
shielding me from hidden currents♪

135
00:13:46,500 --> 00:13:51,340
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

136
00:13:51,340 --> 00:13:55,740
♪Raindrops fall,
one by one, into my dreams♪

137
00:13:57,260 --> 00:13:59,420
♪If they should wake me♪

138
00:13:59,780 --> 00:14:01,940
♪Hardship will always remain♪

139
00:14:02,300 --> 00:14:07,140
♪Amid treacherous waters,
few make it to the end♪

140
00:14:07,500 --> 00:14:12,500
♪How could a thousand words
soothe this aching heart?♪

141
00:14:12,500 --> 00:14:17,620
♪With guilt in my heart,
how could I ask to meet again?♪

142
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:24,660
♪May I be like a firefly
awakening in the dark♪

143
00:14:24,660 --> 00:14:29,860
♪Even if I only cast light
on one cycle of bloom and decay♪

144
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:35,540
♪If only I could move someone's heart♪

145
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:40,460
♪I'd spend every dawn
and dusk to see it through♪

146
00:14:40,780 --> 00:14:45,940
♪May I be like a firefly
awakening in the dark♪

147
00:14:45,940 --> 00:14:51,540
♪Even if I only
illuminate a single corner♪

148
00:14:51,900 --> 00:14:56,740
♪If I could bring
light to someone's eyes♪

149
00:14:56,740 --> 00:15:04,900
♪I'd spend this life
and call it courage♪

150
00:15:24,360 --> 00:15:25,672
I don't want to paint anymore.

151
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,968
(Lin Zhaoxiang's Study)
Before you've even arrived,

152
00:15:29,519 --> 00:15:32,840
the fragrance of plum blossoms
has already drifted in,

153
00:15:33,759 --> 00:15:36,639
leaving me unable to concentrate.

154
00:15:41,919 --> 00:15:42,879
On my way here,

155
00:15:43,192 --> 00:15:45,224
I saw the red plum
blossoms in full bloom,

156
00:15:45,639 --> 00:15:47,960
so I picked
two branches for you, Grandfather.

157
00:15:49,960 --> 00:15:50,600
Sit.

158
00:15:53,416 --> 00:15:55,750
His Majesty has summoned
scholars from far and wide

159
00:15:56,039 --> 00:15:57,960
to compile the Compendium of Literature,

160
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:02,279
but the chief compiler
has yet to be appointed.

161
00:16:03,559 --> 00:16:05,519
The two leading candidates at court

162
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:09,279
are Old Master Zhao
and Grand Secretary Xie.

163
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:12,240
Your father is eager to make his move.

164
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:15,720
He wants to rally
the scholars of Jiangnan

165
00:16:15,799 --> 00:16:18,519
to build support for Old Master Zhao.

166
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:20,519
I've heard about it.

167
00:16:21,399 --> 00:16:22,879
Your father alone

168
00:16:23,200 --> 00:16:26,240
probably can't persuade
the leading scholars to join him.

169
00:16:29,960 --> 00:16:31,360
Do you think our Lin family

170
00:16:31,480 --> 00:16:34,720
should help him or not?

171
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,000
We should.

172
00:17:04,240 --> 00:17:06,880
Can you and the eldest daughter
of the Zhao family

173
00:17:06,920 --> 00:17:08,759
really not make it work?

174
00:17:11,960 --> 00:17:13,000
The sooner a mistake

175
00:17:14,160 --> 00:17:15,359
is corrected, the better.

176
00:17:21,039 --> 00:17:22,519
I originally thought

177
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:25,240
that since our families
are already related by marriage,

178
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:27,480
we've grown too close.

179
00:17:27,960 --> 00:17:30,359
So we shouldn't help with this.

180
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:33,119
I was going to let
your father make his futile efforts

181
00:17:33,519 --> 00:17:36,039
and simply keep up appearances.

182
00:17:38,519 --> 00:17:41,359
Since you've made up your mind,

183
00:17:45,240 --> 00:17:46,640
then this time,

184
00:17:48,240 --> 00:17:50,640
we must help.

185
00:17:55,759 --> 00:17:57,240
Though you chose a military career,

186
00:17:57,759 --> 00:17:59,599
you've earned your place

187
00:17:59,839 --> 00:18:02,319
through your own hard-fought battles.

188
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:07,720
But Zhao Jin is one
of His Majesty's trusted confidants.

189
00:18:07,960 --> 00:18:09,519
We must never offend him.

190
00:18:12,559 --> 00:18:13,559
I understand.

191
00:20:05,240 --> 00:20:05,839
My Lady.

192
00:20:06,000 --> 00:20:07,519
The bed has been warmed with incense.

193
00:20:07,519 --> 00:20:08,759
You can rest now.

194
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:24,000
Young Madam, Lanxiang
is still kneeling outside.

195
00:20:24,039 --> 00:20:25,200
Then let her kneel.

196
00:20:25,200 --> 00:20:26,680
Please show mercy, Young Madam.

197
00:20:29,720 --> 00:20:30,680
In a few days,

198
00:20:31,039 --> 00:20:32,960
it will be First Madam An's birthday.

199
00:20:34,056 --> 00:20:36,056
You'll be going
to celebrate her birthday.

200
00:20:36,632 --> 00:20:38,070
If you fall out with the Lin family

201
00:20:38,279 --> 00:20:40,000
over a mere maid,

202
00:20:40,279 --> 00:20:42,759
it won't look good when the time comes.

203
00:20:50,400 --> 00:20:51,720
Raise the curtain.

204
00:21:30,984 --> 00:21:32,680
Do you know what you did wrong?

205
00:21:41,640 --> 00:21:42,279
Yes.

206
00:21:43,359 --> 00:21:44,319
Speak up.

207
00:21:48,319 --> 00:21:49,279
Yes...

208
00:21:53,119 --> 00:21:54,240
What did you do wrong?

209
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:56,920
I shouldn't have

210
00:21:58,839 --> 00:21:59,599
gone out

211
00:22:00,839 --> 00:22:01,839
without

212
00:22:03,359 --> 00:22:05,160
Madam Feng's and Zijin's permission

213
00:22:07,200 --> 00:22:08,240
to buy things

214
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:10,319
on my own...

215
00:22:12,232 --> 00:22:13,640
And I certainly shouldn't have

216
00:22:14,640 --> 00:22:15,920
been so careless

217
00:22:16,799 --> 00:22:18,799
and bumped into a customer at the shop,

218
00:22:21,319 --> 00:22:23,440
causing the shop to pay compensation...

219
00:22:29,960 --> 00:22:31,519
I'll be generous

220
00:22:32,759 --> 00:22:34,960
and let this go.

221
00:22:36,200 --> 00:22:38,279
Pay back
what the shop had to compensate,

222
00:22:39,279 --> 00:22:42,200
and we'll consider the matter settled.

223
00:22:43,240 --> 00:22:44,200
Yes...

224
00:22:46,839 --> 00:22:47,559
Get up.

225
00:22:55,839 --> 00:22:56,960
Serves you right.

226
00:23:13,680 --> 00:23:14,319
Lanxiang.

227
00:23:15,640 --> 00:23:16,400
Lanxiang.

228
00:23:20,079 --> 00:23:21,079
It's all my fault.

229
00:23:21,599 --> 00:23:22,519
It's all my fault.

230
00:23:26,559 --> 00:23:27,720
I'll help you back.

231
00:23:37,759 --> 00:23:39,000
Let's go back.

232
00:23:57,920 --> 00:23:58,759
We're almost there.

233
00:24:03,000 --> 00:24:03,880
Lanxiang.

234
00:24:04,440 --> 00:24:05,480
Lanxiang!

235
00:24:15,480 --> 00:24:16,079
Lanxiang.

236
00:24:17,119 --> 00:24:17,440
Here.

237
00:24:17,680 --> 00:24:18,079
Easy.

238
00:24:31,279 --> 00:24:32,200
Take care of Lanxiang.

239
00:24:32,240 --> 00:24:33,400
I'll go get some hot water.

240
00:24:33,519 --> 00:24:34,559
I've got everything ready.

241
00:24:35,279 --> 00:24:35,680
Here.

242
00:24:49,624 --> 00:24:50,550
You're such a dear.

243
00:24:50,616 --> 00:24:52,200
You're truly a godsend.

244
00:24:52,210 --> 00:24:54,950
Someone who's just been chilled
can't be put in hot water right away.

245
00:24:54,960 --> 00:24:56,890
You have to warm
her up slowly with warm water,

246
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:58,340
and then gradually add hotter water.

247
00:24:58,559 --> 00:24:59,279
All right.

248
00:26:08,559 --> 00:26:09,279
Slowly.

249
00:26:09,599 --> 00:26:10,480
Take small sips.

250
00:26:26,079 --> 00:26:27,319
Thank you.

251
00:26:28,839 --> 00:26:30,319
You've finally got some color back.

252
00:26:30,640 --> 00:26:31,839
When you first came in,

253
00:26:32,079 --> 00:26:33,759
you looked so pale. It was frightening.

254
00:26:34,720 --> 00:26:36,400
I should be thanking you.

255
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:39,880
If it weren't for you,

256
00:26:40,400 --> 00:26:43,240
I'd have been the one
who went out with Young Madam today.

257
00:26:43,920 --> 00:26:45,960
You're so cautious,

258
00:26:45,960 --> 00:26:47,224
yet even you ended up like this.

259
00:26:47,440 --> 00:26:49,359
With how scatterbrained I am,

260
00:26:49,799 --> 00:26:51,960
I might've even lost my life.

261
00:26:54,400 --> 00:26:55,759
I wasn't careful enough.

262
00:26:56,839 --> 00:26:58,559
I acted too rashly.

263
00:27:00,720 --> 00:27:01,480
Yingge.

264
00:27:01,920 --> 00:27:02,920
Do you believe that?

265
00:27:03,160 --> 00:27:05,400
I don't believe a word of it.

266
00:27:06,000 --> 00:27:07,400
You really didn't remember.

267
00:27:07,816 --> 00:27:09,352
Don't listen to what you shouldn't hear.

268
00:27:09,559 --> 00:27:11,160
Don't say what you shouldn't say.

269
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:13,039
If Lanxiang says it was her fault,

270
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:15,279
then it was her fault.

271
00:27:18,519 --> 00:27:20,240
How could our masters ever be wrong?

272
00:27:52,000 --> 00:27:53,319
My mother always says

273
00:27:53,896 --> 00:27:55,920
a close neighbor
is better than a distant relative.

274
00:27:58,400 --> 00:28:00,440
Today, I finally
understand what she means.

275
00:28:03,400 --> 00:28:04,799
Thank you for taking care of me.

276
00:28:05,400 --> 00:28:07,200
I'm already acting like a young lady.

277
00:28:15,976 --> 00:28:17,590
The water for my feet has gone cold.

278
00:28:17,759 --> 00:28:18,400
Go

279
00:28:18,759 --> 00:28:20,000
and add some hot water for me.

280
00:28:21,759 --> 00:28:23,200
You little rascal.

281
00:28:23,400 --> 00:28:24,960
Give you an inch and you take a mile.

282
00:28:25,240 --> 00:28:26,160
If that's how it is,

283
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:28,440
then tomorrow night,
you can bring me my footbath.

284
00:28:30,839 --> 00:28:31,720
Me too.

285
00:28:32,759 --> 00:28:33,559
Me too.

286
00:28:35,920 --> 00:28:36,680
All right.

287
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:38,480
Tomorrow, I'll wait on both of you.

288
00:29:47,039 --> 00:29:48,440
Who am I?

289
00:29:50,920 --> 00:29:51,720
Mom.

290
00:29:52,559 --> 00:29:54,440
Why did you come back all of a sudden?

291
00:29:54,440 --> 00:29:56,664
Madam Feng gave me permission
to come home for a visit.

292
00:29:58,056 --> 00:29:59,310
Let me have a good look at you.

293
00:29:59,599 --> 00:30:00,839
Let me see how you've been.

294
00:30:04,079 --> 00:30:05,240
Your hands are freezing.

295
00:30:07,319 --> 00:30:09,079
I'm a second-class maid now.

296
00:30:09,759 --> 00:30:11,319
I don't have to do much hard labor,

297
00:30:11,920 --> 00:30:13,400
and I get enough to eat every day.

298
00:30:13,559 --> 00:30:15,680
Zijin even shares with us

299
00:30:15,720 --> 00:30:17,400
the pastries
Young Madam doesn't finish.

300
00:30:18,160 --> 00:30:20,480
I'm wearing the new
padded jacket you made for me,

301
00:30:20,519 --> 00:30:21,559
so I haven't been cold.

302
00:30:22,160 --> 00:30:22,839
Good.

303
00:30:24,319 --> 00:30:25,160
It's cold outside.

304
00:30:25,440 --> 00:30:26,240
Come inside.

305
00:30:27,784 --> 00:30:28,728
Get some rest first.

306
00:30:28,744 --> 00:30:30,390
I'll make you some steamed egg custard.

307
00:30:30,400 --> 00:30:31,000
Mom.

308
00:30:32,200 --> 00:30:33,720
I have to hurry back.

309
00:30:35,440 --> 00:30:37,519
You just got home.
Why are you leaving already?

310
00:30:40,759 --> 00:30:42,519
Did something happen?

311
00:30:43,920 --> 00:30:46,960
Yesterday, I went out
with Young Madam

312
00:30:47,079 --> 00:30:49,200
to her fabric shop.

313
00:30:49,519 --> 00:30:51,759
I accidentally spilled something

314
00:30:52,240 --> 00:30:54,079
and ruined a customer's fabric.

315
00:30:54,759 --> 00:30:56,480
But Young Madam was generous

316
00:30:56,519 --> 00:30:57,440
and didn't punish me.

317
00:30:58,039 --> 00:31:00,720
She only asked me to repay
what the shop paid the customer.

318
00:31:01,079 --> 00:31:03,799
The wages I've saved aren't enough,

319
00:31:04,160 --> 00:31:05,720
so I came home to see you.

320
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,359
Don't worry.

321
00:31:18,759 --> 00:31:19,759
Listen to me.

322
00:31:20,039 --> 00:31:21,839
Whatever happens, don't be afraid.

323
00:31:23,519 --> 00:31:26,240
The money your father
and I saved is yours, too.

324
00:31:28,839 --> 00:31:30,920
If anything happens, just tell us.

325
00:31:31,680 --> 00:31:32,440
How much

326
00:31:32,759 --> 00:31:33,720
do you need?

327
00:31:35,559 --> 00:31:36,160
Take it.

328
00:31:51,480 --> 00:31:52,160
That's enough.

329
00:31:54,400 --> 00:31:55,240
Take a little more.

330
00:31:55,960 --> 00:31:56,960
Here, take it.

331
00:31:57,000 --> 00:31:58,960
If I get into trouble again,

332
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:00,519
I can come home for money

333
00:32:00,559 --> 00:32:01,960
and see you again.

334
00:32:03,759 --> 00:32:05,279
If I don't need money,

335
00:32:06,000 --> 00:32:07,519
I won't have a chance to come home.

336
00:32:09,519 --> 00:32:10,319
Don't talk nonsense.

337
00:32:10,440 --> 00:32:11,960
There won't be a next time.

338
00:32:13,519 --> 00:32:14,599
May the wind carry those

339
00:32:15,200 --> 00:32:16,079
careless words away.

340
00:32:18,759 --> 00:32:19,519
Mom.

341
00:32:19,720 --> 00:32:21,839
Have you and Dad been well lately?

342
00:32:21,839 --> 00:32:22,519
Yes.

343
00:32:22,759 --> 00:32:23,960
We're both doing well.

344
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:24,759
Very well.

345
00:32:24,759 --> 00:32:25,720
Don't worry.

346
00:32:26,799 --> 00:32:28,039
If anything comes up,

347
00:32:28,039 --> 00:32:29,400
go to Xiaolian's mother.

348
00:32:29,400 --> 00:32:30,240
Tell her

349
00:32:30,279 --> 00:32:31,720
to pass a message to me.

350
00:32:32,039 --> 00:32:32,799
Remember?

351
00:32:40,160 --> 00:32:41,559
Keep the money safe.

352
00:32:48,319 --> 00:32:50,039
Now go back.

353
00:32:50,400 --> 00:32:51,720
The road isn't easy to travel.

354
00:32:52,079 --> 00:32:53,279
Your duties come first.

355
00:32:53,599 --> 00:32:55,160
Don't upset your master.

356
00:32:58,940 --> 00:33:01,500
♪The wind blows past distant hills♪

357
00:33:02,559 --> 00:33:03,000
Go.

358
00:33:06,820 --> 00:33:10,500
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

359
00:33:11,839 --> 00:33:12,279
Go.

360
00:33:17,720 --> 00:33:19,079
Look at me, forgetting again.

361
00:33:19,100 --> 00:33:22,300
♪Ripples stir across my brow♪

362
00:33:22,839 --> 00:33:23,920
I embroidered this for you.

363
00:33:24,599 --> 00:33:25,519
It's pretty, isn't it?

364
00:33:25,519 --> 00:33:26,240
It is.

365
00:33:26,720 --> 00:33:28,720
I kept wanting
to choose an auspicious day

366
00:33:28,759 --> 00:33:29,960
to give this to you.

367
00:33:30,240 --> 00:33:31,400
Since you came home today,

368
00:33:31,510 --> 00:33:33,336
today is
an auspicious day for our family.

369
00:33:33,880 --> 00:33:34,519
Take it.

370
00:33:34,960 --> 00:33:36,119
Replace the old one.

371
00:33:37,192 --> 00:33:38,590
The Chinese New Year is almost here.

372
00:33:38,600 --> 00:33:40,270
I'll change it on
Chinese New Year's Day.

373
00:33:40,296 --> 00:33:42,312
I'll wear
the new sachet in the new year.

374
00:34:00,599 --> 00:34:01,240
Mom.

375
00:34:01,304 --> 00:34:03,224
Young Madam
has sent someone to fetch me.

376
00:34:03,240 --> 00:34:04,240
I have to go.

377
00:34:05,759 --> 00:34:06,519
Go on.

378
00:34:53,760 --> 00:34:54,519
Young Master.

379
00:34:54,920 --> 00:34:55,800
I've brought her.

380
00:34:58,719 --> 00:34:59,400
Young Master.

381
00:35:01,679 --> 00:35:02,599
Come take a look.

382
00:35:13,559 --> 00:35:16,039
This is the Cold Mountain Painting
my father acquired.

383
00:35:18,616 --> 00:35:20,968
Ever since Grandfather
received the Cold Mountain Painting,

384
00:35:21,079 --> 00:35:22,519
he's been unable to put it down

385
00:35:23,079 --> 00:35:24,440
and has copied it over and over.

386
00:35:25,199 --> 00:35:27,840
This is his best copy.

387
00:35:31,280 --> 00:35:33,280
I thought it was the real one.

388
00:35:44,280 --> 00:35:47,360
I heard you taught your father to read.

389
00:35:52,719 --> 00:35:54,360
I was often ill as a child

390
00:35:54,472 --> 00:35:56,710
and used to recite sutras
with the monks at the temple.

391
00:35:57,400 --> 00:35:58,630
That's how I learned to read.

392
00:36:01,000 --> 00:36:01,920
What is this?

393
00:36:09,540 --> 00:36:12,140
(Diamond Sutra)

394
00:36:13,519 --> 00:36:15,000
The Diamond Sutra.

395
00:36:18,679 --> 00:36:20,559
If Young Madam
finds out you can read,

396
00:36:21,559 --> 00:36:22,719
what will happen to you?

397
00:36:24,559 --> 00:36:25,480
And what will happen

398
00:36:26,559 --> 00:36:27,679
to your parents?

399
00:36:38,639 --> 00:36:40,039
I'll end up worse off than Ji'er.

400
00:36:41,199 --> 00:36:44,119
My parents will also
be sold off by Young Madam,

401
00:36:44,840 --> 00:36:46,280
just like Ji'er's parents.

402
00:36:49,920 --> 00:36:51,000
Be my ears

403
00:36:52,000 --> 00:36:52,800
and eyes.

404
00:36:53,800 --> 00:36:56,000
Everything you hear

405
00:36:56,010 --> 00:36:57,560
and see while you're with Zhao Xingtang,

406
00:36:57,599 --> 00:36:58,920
report it all to me.

407
00:37:00,360 --> 00:37:01,800
If you do this well,

408
00:37:03,119 --> 00:37:04,159
I guarantee

409
00:37:06,776 --> 00:37:08,150
your whole family will be safe.

410
00:37:24,060 --> 00:37:26,860
(Diamond Sutra)

411
00:37:26,860 --> 00:37:31,100
♪Spring slips
from the branches once more♪

412
00:37:33,280 --> 00:37:34,639
As servants of the Lin Residence,

413
00:37:34,920 --> 00:37:37,480
we should naturally serve
Young Master with all our hearts.

414
00:37:39,820 --> 00:37:43,500
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

415
00:37:45,159 --> 00:37:45,840
You may go.

416
00:37:47,900 --> 00:37:52,700
♪Though all the world may fade,
time rolls on as countless lives rush by♪

417
00:37:54,380 --> 00:37:58,500
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

418
00:38:01,740 --> 00:38:05,740
♪No page could hold
the longing words can never show♪

419
00:38:07,780 --> 00:38:11,380
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

420
00:38:11,900 --> 00:38:14,820
♪Fades into the past as new wounds rise♪

421
00:38:15,460 --> 00:38:21,180
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

422
00:38:21,620 --> 00:38:26,060
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

423
00:38:26,060 --> 00:38:29,420
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

424
00:38:29,420 --> 00:38:32,980
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

425
00:38:32,980 --> 00:38:35,740
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

426
00:38:35,740 --> 00:38:39,900
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

427
00:38:39,900 --> 00:38:43,220
♪And silver moonlight
to guide me through the night♪

428
00:38:43,220 --> 00:38:46,980
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

429
00:38:46,980 --> 00:38:51,940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

