Young Master.

444
00:40:14,039 --> 00:40:14,960
What if Young Madam

445
00:40:15,030 --> 00:40:16,504
doesn't take Lanxiang to the banquet?

446
00:40:17,519 --> 00:40:19,000
She is proud and haughty.

447
00:40:19,304 --> 00:40:21,030
For an occasion like a birthday banquet,

448
00:40:21,800 --> 00:40:24,000
she would never
allow herself to lose face.

449
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:26,719
Once she learns I won't be attending,

450
00:40:27,360 --> 00:40:28,960
she'll not only take Lanxiang,

451
00:40:29,280 --> 00:40:30,880
but Xiaolian as well,

452
00:40:31,239 --> 00:40:32,679
to win First Madam An's favor

453
00:40:33,159 --> 00:40:34,519
and help her

454
00:40:35,039 --> 00:40:36,440
keep up appearances at the banquet.

455
00:40:40,360 --> 00:40:41,920
Young Madam is certainly calculating.

456
00:40:42,559 --> 00:40:45,119
But she can never
outmaneuver you, Young Master.

457
00:40:45,719 --> 00:40:46,400
Now

458
00:40:47,079 --> 00:40:47,800
the trap is ready,

459
00:40:48,136 --> 00:40:48,840
the bait is set,

460
00:40:49,280 --> 00:40:50,519
and we have our informant.

461
00:40:50,880 --> 00:40:52,880
All that's left is to catch our prey.

462
00:40:55,519 --> 00:40:56,519
What did you say?

463
00:40:58,599 --> 00:41:00,639
Say that again if you dare.

464
00:41:02,159 --> 00:41:02,880
Young Master said

465
00:41:03,048 --> 00:41:05,416
he has important official business
to attend to tomorrow

466
00:41:05,448 --> 00:41:06,990
and won't be able to attend the banquet.

467
00:41:07,160 --> 00:41:08,712
He asked me to inform Young Madam.

468
00:41:33,000 --> 00:41:34,840
If Young Madam
has no further instructions,

469
00:41:35,440 --> 00:41:36,360
I'll take my leave.

470
00:41:47,519 --> 00:41:48,559
All of you, get out!

471
00:41:56,984 --> 00:41:58,150
You should leave for now.

472
00:42:14,519 --> 00:42:15,840
You can't go in right now.

473
00:42:16,199 --> 00:42:18,000
Young Madam is furious.

474
00:42:22,760 --> 00:42:24,000
Nanke came over and said

475
00:42:24,248 --> 00:42:25,710
Young Master won't be able to attend

476
00:42:25,710 --> 00:42:27,448
First Madam An's
birthday banquet tomorrow.

477
00:42:27,679 --> 00:42:28,639
Young Madam was so angry

478
00:42:28,760 --> 00:42:30,239
that she threw a scalding teacup

479
00:42:30,239 --> 00:42:31,639
straight at Nanke.

480
00:42:33,920 --> 00:42:35,360
He's a fool, too.

481
00:42:35,639 --> 00:42:37,199
It was as if he couldn't feel the heat.

482
00:42:37,320 --> 00:42:39,000
He didn't react at all.

483
00:42:39,199 --> 00:42:41,480
He even bowed before leaving.

484
00:42:42,760 --> 00:42:44,599
That only made
Young Madam even angrier.

485
00:43:05,020 --> 00:43:07,700
